   163	## Ledger of hypotheses
   164	
   165	Status vocabulary: *survives* (consistent with every test that ran, with the falsifier named), *open* (no deciding
   166	test yet), *refuted* (a measurement or argument contradicts it), *rejected* (dropped on an argument without a
   167	measurement), *superseded* (replaced by a stronger or cheaper route).
