     1	# Dimension-32 global topology: open work program
     2	
     3	The claim `dimension32-global-topology` in `docs/state/research_state.json` asks for a classification of the
     4	complete dimension-32 two-sided rank strata: components, smooth strata, closure incidences, attachments and integral
