../greater-picture-gpt-daybreak-blue-latest.md:214:[O] All host and Azure jobs require cgroup `MemoryMax`, `MemorySwapMax=0`, a live wall deadline, `MALLOC_ARENA_MAX=2`, and aggregate admission accounting. Kaggle requires a process-tree RSS watchdog. `RLIMIT_AS` is unsuitable. [Compute flags](~/Projects/IBMQuantum/docs/runbooks/compute-flags.md:46)
